{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Hitchin模叠"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“Hitchin 模叠”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Hitchin moduli stack $\\mathcal M_G$ is essentially the total space of the cotangent bundle of $\\mathrm{Bun}_G$, therefore perverse sheaves on $\\mathrm{Bun}_G$ are related to the symplectic geometry of $\\mathcal M_G$ via the characteristic cycle construction. — 恽之伟, Hitchin-type moduli spaces in automorphic representation theory</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛的模空间","text":"主丛的模空间"}},{"Plain":"在主丛 $E$ 处的切空间, 即 $E$ 的无穷小形变的空间 $H^1(X,\\operatorname{ad}E)$, 由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Serre对偶","text":"Serre 对偶"}},{"Plain":"等同于 $H^0(X,\\mathcal K_X\\otimes\\operatorname{ad}E)$, 其元素称为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Higgs场","text":"Higgs 场"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}